# STARFALL DYNASTY — repository ignore rules
# Owner: architect (ADR-0001). Generated contract DTOs and _workspace/ are tracked on purpose.

# ---------- secrets / local config ----------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.claude/settings.local.json
CLAUDE.local.md

# ---------- Rust ----------
# Cargo.lock IS tracked (this repo builds applications, not libraries).
target/
**/*.rs.bk
# server/.sqlx/ IS tracked on purpose: it is the offline metadata that lets the
# workspace build without a database. Never add a .sqlx pattern here (server review R, AC-11).
# server/crates/sim/tests/data/replay/ IS tracked on purpose: the determinism replay
# artifacts are the shared reference Unity EditMode reads by relative path, so they must
# exist in a fresh clone. Never ignore them (ADR-0010 section 3.1).

# ---------- Unity (client/) ----------
# .meta files are tracked. Never ignore them: Unity GUIDs live there.
client/[Ll]ibrary/
client/[Tt]emp/
client/[Oo]bj/
client/[Bb]uild/
client/[Bb]uilds/
client/[Ll]ogs/
client/[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
client/[Mm]emoryCaptures/
client/[Rr]ecordings/
client/.utmp/
client/ExportedObj/
client/*.csproj
client/*.sln
client/*.slnx
client/*.suo
client/*.user
client/*.userprefs
client/*.unityproj
client/*.booproj
client/*.pidb
client/*.pdb
client/*.mdb
client/*.opendb
client/*.VC.db
client/*.apk
client/*.aab
client/*.app
client/*.unitypackage
client/crashlytics-build.properties
client/sysinfo.txt
# Unity test/coverage output written next to the project
client/test-results.xml
client/CodeCoverage/
# Generated contract DTOs (client/Assets/_Project/Scripts/Contracts/Generated/**) and every
# .meta file ARE tracked. Never ignore *.meta: Unity GUID references live there.

# ---------- .NET tooling (tools/codegen) ----------
tools/**/bin/
tools/**/obj/
tools/**/*.user

# ---------- Python / Node helpers ----------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
node_modules/

# ---------- local infrastructure ----------
# docker compose named volumes live in Docker, but bind mounts must not land in git
.docker-data/
*.pgdata/

# ---------- agent workspace ----------
# _workspace/ is the audit trail and IS tracked. Only volatile output is ignored.
_workspace/**/logs/
_workspace/**/tmp/
_workspace/**/*.log

# ---------- OS / editors ----------
# .vscode/ is ignored: Unity's VS Code integration generates per-machine settings
# (absolute paths, file excludes) and we share nothing there yet. If a shared config
# is ever needed, un-ignore just that file (e.g. !.vscode/extensions.json).
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vs/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# 화면 녹화는 추적하지 않는다 — SC-59 육안 검증 1회가 153 MB 였다.
# 관찰 기록(.md)과 색인 프레임(.png)은 추적하므로 증거 사슬은 끊기지 않는다.
# (리더가 2026-09-23 추가 — architect 확인 대기. 이 파일의 "volatile output만 무시" 원칙에 따른 것)
_workspace/**/*.mp4
_workspace/**/*.mkv
